            "biography": "Hello, I'm <span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: var(--color-cream)\">Threona</span>!<br/><br/>I am a <span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: var(--color-cream)\">Technical Artist, Game Developer, and Software Engineer</span> who loves standing at the intersection of logical engineering and digital art.<br/><br/>My passion lies in crafting games with groundbreaking experiences and compelling narratives, where every line of code and every frame serves to resonate with the player's emotions.<br/>Beyond making games, I have a deep-seated love for building custom software and tools that streamline the game dev and graphics pipelines, turning the most ambitious ideas into smooth, playable realities.<br/><br/>When I close my laptop, you'll find me diving into virtual worlds as an avid gamer, losing myself in good music, hitting the open road for a road trip, or battling it out on the basketball court with friends."
