                    "date": "Jan 2024 — Present",
                    "desc": "<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle; padding-left: 2em;\"><li><b>Pipeline & Tool Development:</b> Designed and implemented end-to-end character art pipelines, authoring custom Python automation scripts for Maya, Photoshop, and Blender to streamline/enhanced content creation and asset management.</li><li><b>Unreal Engine Tooling:</b> Engineered in-editor workflow utilities and custom tools in Unreal Engine using Editor Utility Widgets and C++ to eliminate repetitive artist tasks and boost team productivity.</li><li><b>Full-Stack Pipeline Apps:</b> Built standalone desktop/web pipeline tools using Python backends and React frontends, providing artists with intuitive interfaces to interact seamlessly with DCC software and asset management systems.</li><li><b>Shaders & Visual Effects:</b> Authored real-time material shaders and dynamic particle/VFX systems in Unreal Engine, balancing high visual fidelity with strict <br/>frame-rate budget constraints.</li></ul>",
